- [ ] The first click sends nothing and draws an alertdialog naming the cosmetic and the tier (tests 1 and 2).
- [ ] Confirm sends exactly one POST (test 3). Cancel and Escape send none and restore the offer, and Escape leaves the card view open (test 4).
- [ ] Cancel has focus when the question opens (tests 1 and 5).
- [ ] A refusal shows the server's words and changes nothing (the existing refusal tests, now confirming first).
- [ ] The zh-CN entries are added, and `i18n.test.ts` passes.
