- **The CSS sheet tests.** `palette.test.ts` and `typescale.test.ts` fail on any colour literal or font size in `tokenOffer.css`. Use only the `var(...)` values given.
- **Testid prefix.** The existing check `[data-testid^="collection-token-offer-"]` is null only after a redemption, when every offer has unmounted, so the new ids keep it true.
- **Strings.** Keep both `t()` arguments literal (two calls, not a template) so the i18n scan finds their entries.

## Open questions

None needs a person. These are the decisions taken, with the alternatives rejected:

- **Styles.** The question has its own classes in `tokenOffer.css`. Importing `shop/shop.css` into the Collection for `.token-confirm`, or moving that rule, was rejected.
